MESCHACH MODIFICATIONS (leukocyte-hip/meschach_lib)

This directory holds a modified copy of the Meschach Library 1.2b,
Copyright (C) 1993 David E. Stewart & Zbigniew Leyk. The Meschach
license (see `copyright` in this directory) requires every modified copy
to say who made the last modification and when, and that no charge is
made for the library or works derived from it.

Who and when:
  Modified for HeCBench (https://github.com/zjin-lcf/HeCBench) by HeCBench
  contributors, before 2023-09-21 (the exact dates were not recorded).
  A few files were already modified in the Rodinia benchmark suite
  (University of Virginia), from which this copy was taken. HeCBench's
  changes were identified by comparing with the Rodinia copy in
  https://github.com/yuhc/gpu-rodinia (cuda/leukocyte/meschach_lib/).

What was changed (portability to modern C/C++ and CUDA/HIP/SYCL compilers):
  - the max()/min() macros were renamed macro_max()/macro_min() so they
    do not clash with the C++ standard library;
  - error and warning message tables were made const-correct;
  - void* wrapper functions (wrapped_m_free() and similar) were added
    for the free routines;
  - <unistd.h> includes were added;
  - the makefile's compiler flags were changed.

